# workladder decision table (DefaultPolicy; a due entry; next = the wait to the next look)

| state | quiet | quiet, degraded | gate held | not quiet | runtime dead |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| trigger/assigned, attempts < 3 | nudge 3; next 12m0s | paused nudge; next 6m0s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s |
| trigger/assigned, attempts >= 3 | recycle + nudge 4; next 1h0m0s | paused nudge; next 10m0s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s |
| trigger/assigned, >= 3, recycled 10m ago | nudge 5; next 1h0m0s | paused nudge; next 10m0s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s |
| continuation/assigned, attempts < 6 | nudge 6; next 1h0m0s | paused nudge; next 10m0s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s |
| continuation/assigned, attempts >= 6 | alert continuation_unanswered + nudge 7; next 1h0m0s | paused nudge; next 10m0s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s |
| continuation/assigned, >= 6, alerted | nudge 8; next 1h0m0s | paused nudge; next 10m0s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s |
| claim/claimed, attempts < 3 | nudge 3; next 12m0s | paused nudge; next 6m0s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s |
| claim/claimed, attempts >= 3 | release; next 1m30s | paused nudge; next 10m0s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s |
| claim/started, attempts < 6 | nudge 6; next 1h0m0s | paused nudge; next 10m0s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s |
| claim/started, >= 6, recycles 0 < R | recycle (keep claim); next 1h0m0s | paused nudge; next 10m0s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s |
| claim/started, >= 6, recycles 1 = R | alert started_unanswered + nudge 7; next 1h0m0s | paused nudge; next 10m0s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s |
| claim/escalated | nudge 10; next 1h0m0s | paused nudge; next 10m0s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s | -; next 1m30s |
